<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_喜爱、钦佩、迷恋与同情怜悯 (Cherishing, Admiring, Sympathizing & Revering)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 6 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='19%'>核心动词 & 语域层级</th><th width='12%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='19%'>中文释义</th><th width='18%'>英文精准定义</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='27%'>🔄 Phrasal Verb 替换 & 语域阶梯</th></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>compassionate<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>compassionate<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 3e gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to compassionate</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kәm'pæʃәnit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/compassionate/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('compassionate', 'compassionate')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 怜悯, 同情</td><td class='def-en'>share the suffering of</td><td>3.55</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>condole with</span><span class='pv-pill'>feel for</span><span class='pv-pill'>sympathize with</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>pity</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to compassionate (share the suffering of).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>cherish<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>aimer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to cherish</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'tʃeriʃ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛme/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('cherish', 'aimer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 珍爱, 怀有, 爱护</td><td class='def-en'>be fond of; be attached to</td><td>3.52</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>care for</span><span class='pv-pill'>hold dear</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>treasure</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“They decided to cherish (be fond of).”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Vivid' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>revere<span class='reg-Vivid'>🎨 生动/叙事</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>adorer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to revere</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ri'viә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/adɔʁe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('revere', 'adorer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 崇敬, 敬畏, 尊敬</td><td class='def-en'>love unquestioningly and uncritically or to excess; venerate as an idol</td><td>3.09</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>drool over</span><span class='pv-pill'>slobber over</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>idolize</span><span class='fm-pill'>idolise</span><span class='fm-pill'>reverence</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>worship</span><span class='nt-pill'>hero-worship</span><span class='nt-pill'>fear</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Many teenagers idolized the Beatles”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Formal' data-pv='1'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>idolize<span class='reg-Formal'>🏛️ 正式/学术</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>adorer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to idolize</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'aidәlaiz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/adɔʁe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('idolize', 'adorer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 把...当偶像崇拜, 极端崇拜, 醉心于；vi. 崇拜偶像</td><td class='def-en'>love unquestioningly and uncritically or to excess; venerate as an idol</td><td>2.48</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>💬 <b>短语动词 (Phrasal):</b> <span class='pv-pill'>drool over</span><span class='pv-pill'>slobber over</span></div><div>🏛️ <b>正式/学术升级:</b> <span class='fm-pill'>idolise</span></div><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>worship</span><span class='nt-pill'>hero-worship</span><span class='nt-pill'>revere</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Many teenagers idolized the Beatles”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>prefer<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>aimer mieux<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to prefer</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/pri'fә:/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛme mjø/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('prefer', 'aimer mieux')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 宁可, 较喜欢, 提出</td><td class='def-en'>like better; value more highly</td><td>4.57</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div>⚖️ <b>通用同义替换:</b> <span class='nt-pill'>choose</span><span class='nt-pill'>opt</span></div><div class='ex-line'>“Some people prefer camping to staying in hotels”</div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-reg='Neutral' data-pv='0'><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>adore<span class='reg-Neutral'>⚖️ 通用核心</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>adorer<span class='fr-gr-badge'>v. 1er gr.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 to adore</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ә'dɒ:/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/adɔʁe/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('adore', 'adorer')">🔊</button></td><td>vt. 崇拜, 爱慕, 喜爱；vi. 崇拜, 爱慕</td><td class='def-en'>love intensely</td><td>3.7</td><td><div class='ladder-box'><div class='ex-line'>“he just adored his wife”</div></div></td></tr>
